{"articleNo":"117537","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=117537&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015년 1학기 국가장학금 신청안내('14.11.20~'14.12.8, 18시까지)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.11.18","hit":"5085","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"WIDTH: 505px; HEIGHT: 499px\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/upload/b5755f6f-a3da-43a0-aeb7-6cc891bdfd37.jpg\" width=\"458\" height=\"501\"> </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 국가장학금을 아래와 같이 접수하오니, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청하시기 바랍니다.</span><br><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘14. 11. 20(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">목</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 9</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">~ 12. 8(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 18</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시</span><br><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한국장학재단 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">접속 후 신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><br><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">신청 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">:‘15</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학년도 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학기 등록 예정자</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">복학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재입학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">편입학 등</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><br><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주요 안내 사항</span><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가장학금</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학자금대출</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가근로장학금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">통합 신청</span><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">국가장학금을 받으려면</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가구원 정보제공 동의</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">가 필요</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한국장학재단</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><br><br><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">문의 전화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">한국장학재단 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1599 - 2000</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 22.5pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">11</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">18</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">일</span><br><br><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학 생 처</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
